      "@id": "#claim",
      "@type": "Claim",
      "name": "Entry 31: the D1 protocol correction — frozen re-run, the D2∩D5 discovery, and the review-v2 response",
      "text": "The calibration corpus re-run blind lands at 8.2% (F3) against the simulation's 8.4%, versus 3.5%/5.2% informed — an informed→blind shift of +4.6 pp on F3 and +3.2 on the simulation. Parity survives the protocol change; the absolute level does not. The same re-run discovered that 58 of D2's 62 rides are already in D5, which is why D2 is excluded from the headline pool.",
      "appearance": [
